  "description": "Bowire security scanner — Tier-1 anchor of the security-testing lane. Loads vulnerability templates (BowireRecordings flagged with `attack: true`), replays them against a target, evaluates the AttackPredicate against the response, and emits findings as SARIF 2.1.0. Ships with built-in passive checks (TLS-version enumeration, version-disclosing headers, verbose-error detection). Pluggable: scoped, auth-header-aware, per-probe timeout-bounded.",
